Fahrenheit Seafood and Grill Website

Author: Mbali Dlamini
Student Number: ST10506754
Module: WEDE Part 2

Project Description:
This responsive multi-page website promotes Fahrenheit Seafood and Grill. It presents the restaurant's menu, dining experience, contact information, reservations, and enquiry options.

Pages and Features:
- index.html: restaurant landing page, searchable menu, photo gallery, FAQs, and reservation form
- contact.html: contact details, contact form, and location map
- enquiry.html: categorized enquiry form
- Shared responsive styling and JavaScript interactions
- Netlify Forms integration for online form submissions

Technologies Used:
- HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and JSON
- Netlify Forms
- Google Maps embed
- Real photographs credited under their respective reuse licences in README.md

Project Aim:
To provide a professional and accessible online presence for the restaurant, with clear information and usable forms across desktop and mobile devices.

